\ A three-deep chain ending in a raising non-generic native, with no call in tail position, so
\ every frame renders.
\
\ The interpreter, eager, and AOT runs of this program must render the chain frame for frame
\ identically; the integration and AOT twins share this source verbatim.

inner: ( s v -- n ) [ stream-write 0 + ] ;
outer: ( s v -- n ) [ inner 0 + ] ;

stdout 42 outer .
